<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bowser> <http://dbpedia.org/property/footer> "Super Mario Bros. is Bowser's first video game appearance as the villainous boss. Miyamoto  and Tezuka then began collaboration on Bowser's new image fitting for the commander of the turtle-like Koopa Troopas. Miyamoto said in his final design that he could make Bowser \"look cool today\"." .
