<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Wii_Sports> <http://dbpedia.org/property/alt> "Artwork of a vertical rectangular box. The top third displays three screen shots from the game: two characters with boxing gloves fighting in a boxing ring, a character holding a bowling ball at a ball pit, and a character holding a golf at the putting green of a golf course The Wii logo is shown at the upper left corner. The center portion reads \"Wii Sports\" over five blue boxes depicting different sports equipment. The third displays two more screen shots from the game: a character holding a Tennis racket at a Tennis Court and a character swinging a Baseball bat in a stadium. The PEGI \"7+\" rating is shown on the bottom left corner and the Nintendo logo is on the bottom right corner." .
