<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kirby_Super_Star> <http://dbpedia.org/property/text> "As for why I made it an \"omnibus,\" I did it because I thought we were seeing too many games that took too long to beat. At the time, more and more massive games kept hitting the market. And they all took a long time to finish. By creating an \"omnibus\" collection of quick-to-beat individual scenarios, each complete with their own unique gameplay, I thought I could provide a lot of content without causing players to grow tired of any one style." .
